{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Zerun?</strong><br>A shamanic initiation. A vision quest through a labyrinth of danger and meaning. You are not truly here \u2014 yet what happens here shapes the world you left behind. Walk the path of the shaman. Solve ancient puzzles, survive the trials, and gather what\u2019s needed to heal your world. Earn every artifact, complete every rite, and bring your world back to life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to walk the path.</strong> Play at your own pace in Explorer Mode, where the journey is yours to unfold. Or test your instincts in Time Challenge Mode, where every second counts and the pressure never sleeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two soundtracks, one world.</strong> Choose between two distinct audio styles: a dynamic soundtrack \u2014 fast, rhythmic, and designed to push you toward better times and higher leaderboard ranks \u2014 or an atmospheric soundtrack that surrounds you in sacred stillness and dreamlike calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world seen through ritual eyes.</strong><br>Your view is curved and dreamlike, a spiritual tunnel guiding your senses. What you see may deceive \u2014 but every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze is alive.</strong> <br>Run. React. Adapt. Paths shift. Traps awaken. Sacred items must be earned \u2014 nothing is given for free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you complete the rite?</strong><br>Master the trials. Gather the green artifacts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heal the world. Become the shaman you were meant to be.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3801360/d3941d62d4be9defe5ef7e107cd6c99f3537645a.jpg"},{"name":"Wooden Crown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/380